a properties\n    Autores: RICARDO ALONSO GONZALEZ VALENZUELA\n    Colaboradores: TERESITA CONCEPCION MEDRANO PESQUEIRA HILDA ESPERANZA ESPARZA PONCE RICARDO ANTONIO RODRIGUEZ MIJANGOS VLADIMIR SERGEIVICH TERPUGOV MO\u00d1KINA JOSE ALBERTO DUARTE MOLLER\n    Nivel de acceso: Acceso Abierto\n    Licencia: Sin Derechos Reservados\n    Materia: Glycine lithium nitrate non-linear optical\n    Resumen: Crystals of glycine lithium nitrate with non-linear optical properties have bee grown in a solution by slow evaporation at room temperature. The crystal shows a good thermal stability from room t0emperature to 175 \u25e6C where the crystal begins to degrade. This property is desirable for future technological applications. Also, a good performance on the second harmonic generation was found, characterizing the emitted dominant wavelength by a customized indirect procedure using luminance and chromaticity measured data based on the CIE-1931 standard. Additionally, the 532 nm signal was detected by using a variant to the Kurtz and Perry method.\n    Fecha de publicaci\u00f3n: 2009\n    Tipo de publicaci\u00f3n: Art\u00edculo\n    Idioma: Ingl\u00e9s\n    \u00c1rea de conocimiento: OTRAS\n    Colecciones: Art\u00edculos": [0.05383819341659546, 0.0, 0.05383819341659546, 0.0, 0.16151458024978638, 0.0, 0.0, 0.05383819341659546, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.05383819341659546, 0.16151458024978638, 0.16151458024978638, 0.10767638683319092, 0.0, 0.0, 0.16151458024978638, 0.05383819341659546, 0.16151458024978638, 0.10767638683319092, 0.05383819341659546, 0.05383819341659546, 0.05383819341659546, 0.05383819341659546, 0.0, 0.16151458024978638, 0.0, 0.0, 0.10767638683319092, 0.05383819341659546, 0.0, 0.0, 0.05383819341659546, 0.05383819341659546, 0.0, 0.0, 0.10767638683319092, 0.05383819341659546, 0.16151458024978638, 0.16151458024978638, 0.05383819341659546, 0.05383819341659546, 0.05383819341659546, 0.05383819341659546, 0.16151458024978638, 0.0, 0.16151458024978638, 0.0, 0.0, 0.10767638683319092, 