are\ndramatically reduced. A possible solution to this dilemma is the use of Al-based composites (AlBCs)\nreinforced with ceramic particles, those materials offer increased physical properties and several\nadvantages [1,2] over conventional alloys. Their properties are controlled to a large extent by the\nconcentration, structure and characteristics of the reinforcement metal interfaces [3]. AlBCs are\noften prepared by powder metallurgy route [4] where a homogeneous distribution of the\nreinforcement particles [5] and matrix grain refining by severe plastic deformation [6] are achieved.\n    Fecha de publicaci\u00f3n: 2011\n    Tipo de publicaci\u00f3n: Memoria de congreso\n    Idioma: Ingl\u00e9s\n    \u00c1rea de conocimiento: OTRAS\n    Colecciones: Art\u00edculos de Congresos": [0.044065266847610474, 0.0, 0.08813053369522095, 0.0, 0.08813053369522095, 0.044065266847610474, 0.044065266847610474, 0.044065266847610474, 0.0, 0.0, 0.044065266847610474, 0.044065266847610474, 0.08813053369522095, 0.044065266847610474, 0.13219580054283142, 0.0, 0.044065266847610474, 0.22032633423805237, 0.26439160108566284, 0.13219580054283142, 0.0, 0.08813053369522095, 0.044065266847610474, 0.0, 0.044065266847610474, 0.044065266847610474, 0.0, 0.0, 0.13219580054283142, 0.08813053369522095, 0.0, 0.13219580054283142, 0.044065266847610474, 0.13219580054283142, 0.044065266847610474, 0.08813053369522095, 0.08813053369522095, 0.044065266847610474, 0.044065266847610474, 0.13219580054283142, 0.044065266847610474, 0.08813053369522095, 0.0, 0.044065266847610474, 0.044065266847610474, 0.08813053369522095, 0.044065266847610474, 0.1762610673904419, 0.044065266847610474, 0.044065266847610474, 0.044065266847610474, 0.044065266847610474, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.08813053369522095, 0.26439160108566284, 0.044065266847610474, 0.0, 0.0, 0.044065266847610474, 0.13219580054283142, 0.08813053369522095, 0.13219580054283142, 0.044065266847610474, 0.0, 0.13219580054283142, 0.0, 0.0, 0.1762610673904419, 0.0, 0.04406526